Dialogue: 1,0:00:05.08,0:00:08.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wait, your dad's been dead for years?
Dialogue: 1,0:00:08.21,0:00:11.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yeah. I heard her loud and clear.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:12.33,0:00:17.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,She said it when she was on\Nthe phone with his mom.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:18.25,0:00:21.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,And you're sure she was\Ntalking about your dad?!
Dialogue: 1,0:00:21.46,0:00:22.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Senpai...
Dialogue: 1,0:00:22.58,0:00:23.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,You're sure you're not taking\Nsomething out of context?!
Dialogue: 1,0:00:24.88,0:00:28.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,She didn't say my dad's name...
Dialogue: 1,0:00:28.79,0:00:33.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,But she was talking to his mom.\NWho else would they be talking about?
Dialogue: 1,0:00:34.21,0:00:37.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,And the way she said "it doesn't matter"...
Dialogue: 1,0:00:37.25,0:00:40.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,like she really doesn't\Ncare about him anymore.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:40.50,0:00:44.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Like she doesn't want anything to do with him at all.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:44.75,0:00:48.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,And why didn't she tell me he's gone?
Dialogue: 1,0:00:48.83,0:00:51.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,I love my dad.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:51.25,0:00:55.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Hearing how much she hates him just,\Nlike, broke me.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:56.42,0:01:00.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,I was too scared to even say anything.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:48.54,0:02:49.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Aria-chan...
Dialogue: 1,0:02:53.96,0:02:55.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,Ririsa...
Dialogue: 1,0:02:56.79,0:03:01.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Mayura-sama taught me this might help you feel better.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:02.79,0:03:04.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Nono-pi...
Dialogue: 1,0:03:14.88,0:03:16.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Mikarin!
Dialogue: 1,0:03:20.79,0:03:21.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,You coming?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:21.83,0:03:23.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'll pass!
Dialogue: 1,0:03:24.04,0:03:25.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 1,0:03:27.25,0:03:29.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,My heart's with you.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:34.38,0:03:37.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Thanks, everyone.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:44.88,0:03:49.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,C'mon, we're doing detail work today, right?\NUp and at 'em, girls!
Dialogue: 1,0:03:49.00,0:03:50.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wait, but...
Dialogue: 1,0:03:50.46,0:03:55.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,We can't abandon our cosplays now!\NNot when I'm finding out how fun this is!
Dialogue: 1,0:03:56.50,0:04:00.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Besides, the most important thing\Nis showing him how much I love him.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:01.58,0:04:03.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,That's why people visit their family's graves, right?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:03.88,0:04:06.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,I think it depends on the person...
Dialogue: 1,0:04:06.13,0:04:09.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Plus, if Okumura died on us...
Dialogue: 1,0:04:09.04,0:04:10.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wait, what?!
Dialogue: 1,0:04:10.13,0:04:13.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,I bet Liliel would be waiting for\Nhim at the gates of heaven.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:14.83,0:04:17.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,My dad loved his manga.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:17.42,0:04:19.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm sure Melia is there waiting to open the gates for him.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:21.96,0:04:23.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,C'mon, Ririsa, let's get started!
Dialogue: 1,0:04:23.79,0:04:24.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,O-okay!
Dialogue: 1,0:04:24.71,0:04:26.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wait, let me try on the skirt first.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:26.88,0:04:28.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Okay, I'll step out!
Dialogue: 1,0:04:32.96,0:04:35.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Aria's tougher than I thought.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:36.08,0:04:38.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Maybe she's pretending she's okay,
Dialogue: 1,0:04:38.50,0:04:41.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,but the fact that she can\Njust shows how tough she is.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:41.38,0:04:45.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,But, something just doesn't feel right...
Dialogue: 1,0:04:45.50,0:04:48.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,The same something\NI felt when started talking about VB.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:48.88,0:04:52.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure what, though...
Dialogue: 1,0:04:53.88,0:04:58.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,But, something's telling me that Kisaki-sensei isn't dead.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:00.04,0:05:02.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna have to do some research.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:11.79,0:05:14.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wow, what a feast!
Dialogue: 1,0:05:14.33,0:05:15.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,What inspired you today?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:15.92,0:05:18.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,I was lost in thought and ended\Nup making way too much.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:19.25,0:05:21.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Aww, thanks, Aria.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:21.50,0:05:26.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna be swamped with orders for\NObon season starting tomorrow.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:27.63,0:05:28.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Hey, Mom?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:28.67,0:05:30.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,What? I'm right here.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:30.79,0:05:34.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Do you think marrying Dad was a mistake?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:34.25,0:05:36.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Huh? Where's this coming from?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:36.58,0:05:40.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Do you think you should've\Nmarried a rich guy instead?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:40.00,0:05:45.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,I don't mind not having money,\Nso long as I can live a happy life.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:48.38,0:05:51.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wait, do you think I divorced\Nhim because he had no money?!
Dialogue: 1,0:05:53.33,0:05:57.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,I divorced him because he lost sight of his dream.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:57.75,0:05:58.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:59.75,0:06:01.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm partially to blame, too.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:02.83,0:06:07.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,I turned his passion into a tool to bring\Nin money and support our family.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:08.25,0:06:15.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,We were unhappy, and I knew if I stayed with him,\NI'd only make him less happy.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:15.42,0:06:18.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,So I did what was best for both of us.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:19.21,0:06:21.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,So you don't hate him?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:21.33,0:06:23.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Your father was a good man.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:23.04,0:06:25.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,He just wasn't the right\Nperson for me or our family.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:27.13,0:06:28.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Look, Aria.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:29.42,0:06:33.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Life is a long series of one event after another.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:33.75,0:06:38.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,You can look back on them and call those\Nevents successes or mistakes if you want.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:38.75,0:06:42.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,But you can't change how you\Nfelt at the time they happened.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:42.79,0:06:47.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,You don't have to say you hate someone\Njust because you broke up with them.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:47.79,0:06:51.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,I was happy then, and happy now.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:51.67,0:06:58.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Back then, I loved him with my whole heart.\NThat fact will never change.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:58.58,0:06:59.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Mom...
Dialogue: 1,0:07:00.25,0:07:02.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Life is about finding happiness.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:02.54,0:07:06.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,Don't waste it on a man\Nwho won't give that to you.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:08.33,0:07:09.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:14.08,0:07:16.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Morning, babes!
Dialogue: 1,0:07:17.83,0:07:18.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Aria-chan!
Dialogue: 1,0:07:19.25,0:07:21.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm glad you're doing better!
Dialogue: 1,0:07:21.00,0:07:23.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm like, better than better.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:23.00,0:07:25.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wait, what's with the tension over there?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:25.42,0:07:28.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,Senpai's been like this all day.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:28.17,0:07:30.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,I think he's trying to find something online?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:34.08,0:07:36.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,What'd you find, Senpai?!
Dialogue: 1,0:07:36.54,0:07:39.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,I felt like something was off yesterday...
Dialogue: 1,0:07:39.79,0:07:44.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,So I started doing some research on Aria's dad.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:45.00,0:07:45.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 1,0:07:47.21,0:07:48.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Check this out.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:48.75,0:07:52.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,I found a bonus manga that wasn't\Npublished in any of the VB volumes.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:52.96,0:07:55.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Whoa, I can't believe you dug this up!
Dialogue: 1,0:07:56.08,0:07:57.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Look at this!
Dialogue: 1,0:07:59.25,0:08:03.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,"Our esteemed master" is what\NTakamatsu-sensei's assistants all called him!
Dialogue: 1,0:08:03.71,0:08:06.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,No one else online seems to have noticed,\Nbut I'm pretty sure of it...
Dialogue: 1,0:08:06.63,0:08:10.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Kisaki-sensei was an apprentice to the author\Nof the Ashford Chronicles, Takamatsu-sensei!
Dialogue: 1,0:08:11.04,0:08:14.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,The guy who created Liliel? I had no idea...
Dialogue: 1,0:08:14.42,0:08:16.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Dad never talked about his work at home.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:16.96,0:08:19.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,Even if he did,\NI was too little to remember.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:19.50,0:08:24.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,That's probably why people said\NVB was similar to Ashford Chronicles.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:24.21,0:08:27.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,And probably why the Liliel\Nanime felt so familiar to me, too.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:28.21,0:08:30.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,So, what does this all mean?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:30.58,0:08:35.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,It'll all make sense when you\Nsee this next thing I discovered!
Dialogue: 1,0:08:37.67,0:08:38.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Look at this right here!
Dialogue: 1,0:08:40.96,0:08:42.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,That's Melia!
Dialogue: 1,0:08:42.29,0:08:44.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,No, look closer!
Dialogue: 1,0:08:44.83,0:08:46.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,At her ear?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:46.38,0:08:49.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Every manga artist has their own way of drawing ears.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:49.88,0:08:54.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Even if their art style changes,\Ntheir ear design usually stays the same.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:55.67,0:08:57.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,You can always tell by the ears.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:57.83,0:09:00.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Senpai, why are you bringing this up?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:00.50,0:09:02.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Ririsa, look closely.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:03.38,0:09:04.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,Do you recognize that ear?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:06.38,0:09:08.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wait, no way...
Dialogue: 1,0:09:08.54,0:09:11.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Okay, why are you freaking out?!
Dialogue: 1,0:09:12.75,0:09:13.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Aria...
Dialogue: 1,0:09:15.25,0:09:17.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Your dad isn't dead.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:18.50,0:09:19.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,...what?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:20.42,0:09:23.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,F-for real?! How do you know?!
Dialogue: 1,0:09:23.21,0:09:24.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,And hold up...
Dialogue: 1,0:09:24.83,0:09:27.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Why is Okumura crying?!
Dialogue: 1,0:09:27.42,0:09:34.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,If Kisaki-sensei had died years ago,\Nthen none of this would be here...
Dialogue: 1,0:09:37.25,0:09:42.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,I think after his divorce,\Nhe couldn't get a new series picked up...
Dialogue: 1,0:09:42.38,0:09:46.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,...so, because his art style was similar,\Nhe found work with his old master.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:46.29,0:09:47.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wait...
Dialogue: 1,0:09:48.29,0:09:51.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,He changed his pen name and kept making manga.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:52.25,0:09:54.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,A spinoff of his former master's manga.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:56.33,0:09:57.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Aria...
Dialogue: 1,0:09:58.92,0:10:00.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,I think your dad...
Dialogue: 1,0:10:02.79,0:10:04.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,...wrote our bible,
Dialogue: 1,0:10:05.42,0:10:07.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Liliel: Side Story!
Dialogue: 1,0:10:09.58,0:10:11.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,How's it going, Sensei?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:12.13,0:10:13.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Sensei?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:13.83,0:10:14.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Kisaki-san!
Dialogue: 1,0:10:16.88,0:10:20.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Sorry, I thought you'd be out today.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:20.50,0:10:23.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Classical music?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:23.04,0:10:25.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,So that's what you're always\Nlistening to on your headphones.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:25.29,0:10:29.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Osamu Tezuka-sensei said to listen\Nto the highest form of music, so...
Dialogue: 1,0:10:29.63,0:10:33.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,I think that advice was just for newbies getting started...
Dialogue: 1,0:10:33.33,0:10:35.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,I mean, I did it too, way back when.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:35.42,0:10:38.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Also, you got some fan mail.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:38.58,0:10:42.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Thanks, but could you pass that\Nalong to Takamatsu-sensei?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:43.25,0:10:47.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,You don't want to read it?\NThey're all from fans of Side Story.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:48.13,0:10:52.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Liliel belongs to my esteemed...\NEr, Takamatsu-sensei.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:52.38,0:10:54.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,I just write the spinoff.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:55.67,0:10:59.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,The only fan mail I ever got\Nwas one letter ten years ago.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:59.83,0:11:03.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,C'mon, don't let it go to waste.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:03.21,0:11:05.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm still waiting for my big debut,
Dialogue: 1,0:11:05.50,0:11:08.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,and if I knew I had a single fan,\NI'd be over the moon.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:09.04,0:11:11.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,And you're sure about that?
Dialogue: 1,0:11:11.04,0:11:11.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 1,0:11:12.25,0:11:17.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,If a million readers raked your work over the coals,\Nwould you be happy to have a single fan?
Dialogue: 1,0:11:18.79,0:11:20.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Mita-kun, the reason you want to publish in Jump...
Dialogue: 1,0:11:20.92,0:11:23.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,..is so you can have a million\Nreaders fall in love with your work, right?
Dialogue: 1,0:11:23.71,0:11:25.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,True...
Dialogue: 1,0:11:25.21,0:11:28.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,All these failed pitches might be getting to me.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:28.54,0:11:30.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Maybe I wouldn't be happy if that happened.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:30.58,0:11:33.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,No, you'd be over the moon.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:33.25,0:11:34.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,You tricked me!
Dialogue: 1,0:11:34.75,0:11:36.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,I was happy to have a fan, too.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:36.79,0:11:40.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,I felt that, even if those million readers hated it,
Dialogue: 1,0:11:40.88,0:11:44.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,if one person liked it,\Nthen it was worth making.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:45.21,0:11:47.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,You still have it?
Dialogue: 1,0:11:47.08,0:11:50.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,I wish I hadn't sent him such a disappointing response.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:50.79,0:11:54.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,I was so worried he would\Nsuffer for liking my manga.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:54.17,0:11:58.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Everyone was saying it was a garbage rip-off.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:58.83,0:12:01.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,They'd even attack people\Nwho said they read the manga.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:01.21,0:12:03.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,I didn't want him to get\Nbullied for liking my manga.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:03.42,0:12:04.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,It was all too possible.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:05.63,0:12:11.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,But he loved my manga.\NI wish I'd told him how much it meant to me.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:11.96,0:12:17.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,At the time, I truly believed\NI deserved to disappear into obscurity.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:18.54,0:12:23.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Working on the final chapters\Nof a canceled manga
Dialogue: 1,0:12:23.92,0:12:27.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,is a hell I hope you never\Nhave to experience, Mita-kun.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:27.79,0:12:33.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's already tough enough putting\Nout one chapter a week.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:34.21,0:12:44.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,But now, you have to write a thrilling climax for\Na manga no one really cares about anymore.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:44.92,0:12:53.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's like being a comedian who has to finish his set,\Neven though no one's laughing.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:54.33,0:12:58.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,You're sweaty and nauseous,\Nbut you have to stay up on stage.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:58.54,0:13:02.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Soon enough, you start believing them,\Nbut you can't stop making the trash they hate.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:02.50,0:13:05.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,You start to hate your work, to hate yourself.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:05.17,0:13:11.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Every day, every minute that ticks closer\Nto your deadline feels like an eternity.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:14.54,0:13:18.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,There were so many times I thought about\Nturning in something rushed and half-assed.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:18.71,0:13:23.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,But still, there was a boy out there\Nwho thought my manga was good.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:24.71,0:13:30.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Though my work would be read by a million readers,\NI wrote those hundred pages for one boy.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:30.42,0:13:35.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Even now, people only remember the\Nseries for being forgettable garbage.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:36.67,0:13:43.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,But because I didn't throw in the towel,\Nnow I get to keep working as a manga artist.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:44.25,0:13:46.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,All thanks to one fan.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:46.92,0:13:49.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oh, actually, two fans.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:50.63,0:13:53.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,My daughter loved my manga.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:53.13,0:13:55.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,I was so obsessed with work back then,
Dialogue: 1,0:13:55.29,0:13:58.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,I forgot to give her the love\Nand attention she deserved...
Dialogue: 1,0:13:59.00,0:14:01.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,He was the same age as my daughter.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:01.96,0:14:07.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,I hope both of them still love manga now.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:18.04,0:14:20.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Liliel!
Dialogue: 1,0:14:20.92,0:14:21.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:22.08,0:14:22.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Iconic Senpai.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:22.92,0:14:23.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Hello.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:23.83,0:14:24.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Hey, babe!
Dialogue: 1,0:14:25.04,0:14:26.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Okumura?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:26.21,0:14:30.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,I went back to the anime to\Ncheck stuff and got distracted.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:30.00,0:14:33.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Did you ask your mom about that phone call, Aria?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:33.58,0:14:36.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yeah. I asked her about it yesterday, and, uh...
Dialogue: 1,0:14:37.79,0:14:40.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,You mean that call with your grandmother?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:41.63,0:14:45.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,She called about one of his\Nrelatives that passed a while back.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:45.29,0:14:48.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,What?! Why was she calling you about that?!
Dialogue: 1,0:14:48.17,0:14:51.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,God, it's so stupid.\NI lent him 100K yen a long time ago.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:51.63,0:14:54.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,We hit it off at a family funeral,\Nand I was happy to help.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:54.67,0:14:56.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,You hit it off at a funeral?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:56.46,0:14:59.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Anyway, he told me he couldn't pay me back,\Nso I stopped talking to him.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:59.92,0:15:03.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,He died five years ago.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:03.54,0:15:08.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Grandma apparently found out about the\Ndebt and wants to make sure I'm paid back.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:08.46,0:15:12.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,But, I honestly don't care about him or the cash,\Nso I told her to forget it.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:12.63,0:15:14.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Were you just curious, or...
Dialogue: 1,0:15:14.21,0:15:17.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,N-no.... never mind.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:19.13,0:15:23.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,So Okumura was totally right,\NI was taking it out context... My bad.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:23.92,0:15:24.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's okay!
Dialogue: 1,0:15:24.71,0:15:28.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,No, that's good. That all but confirms it.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:28.83,0:15:32.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Kisaki-sensei has to be the author of Liliel: Side Story!
Dialogue: 1,0:15:33.63,0:15:35.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,I still don't fully believe it...
Dialogue: 1,0:15:35.96,0:15:39.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,But, you're the biggest Liliel Otaku in the world,\Nso I think we have to.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:39.79,0:15:44.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Ever since you mentioned it,\NI've noticed how similar the art and story is.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:44.96,0:15:45.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,This is crazy...
Dialogue: 1,0:15:45.96,0:15:50.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,The artist who created the first\Nmanga I fell in love with...
Dialogue: 1,0:15:50.33,0:15:53.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,...has been bringing us new\NLiliel content for the past ten years.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:54.08,0:15:55.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Senpai...
Dialogue: 1,0:15:56.29,0:15:59.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,But, I shouldn't get emotional about\Nthis until we know for sure.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:59.63,0:16:05.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Okay, but if that's true,\Nthen if our Liliel cosplays stand out...
Dialogue: 1,0:16:05.63,0:16:09.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,...then there's a good chance\NKisaki-sensei will hear about them!
Dialogue: 1,0:16:13.13,0:16:17.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Now I'm super pumped to get this done.\NLet's finish our costumes, Ririsa!
Dialogue: 1,0:16:17.29,0:16:21.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yeah! With summer break just around the corner,\Nwe'll have tons of time!
Dialogue: 1,0:16:21.00,0:16:23.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'll help, too!
Dialogue: 1,0:16:23.00,0:16:24.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Don't forget about your homework, though.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:26.13,0:16:27.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Aria-chan, Aria-chan!
Dialogue: 1,0:16:28.50,0:16:30.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wait, that's so good!
Dialogue: 1,0:16:30.88,0:16:31.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,What's good?
Dialogue: 1,0:16:32.04,0:16:33.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Nothing you need to know.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:35.54,0:16:38.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,You guys should know that\NComiket's got its upsides and downsides.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:39.83,0:16:42.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Comiket's absolutely ginormous.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:42.38,0:16:46.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,They've got set locations and structured\Nlines to corral those thousands of attendees.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:46.54,0:16:51.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Photo time is extremely limited,\Nand tons of famous cosplayers will be there, too.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:51.79,0:16:53.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,That includes all four of the Heavenly Queens.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:54.21,0:16:57.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,B-but hey, Liliel and Nono-pi are ranked\Nfifth and fourth on the Rising Stars list!
Dialogue: 1,0:16:57.25,0:17:00.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,First through third will be there, too.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:01.08,0:17:03.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Mr. Camera said he'd announced\Nwho they were before Comiket.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:03.96,0:17:08.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,And our photos will be drowned out by\Nthe ocean of Comiket pics posted online.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:08.13,0:17:12.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's actually harder to go viral from\NComiket than other events.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:12.46,0:17:14.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Especially, Summer Comiket.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:14.29,0:17:16.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's practically haunted.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:16.67,0:17:17.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Haunted?
Dialogue: 1,0:17:17.63,0:17:19.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,We should aim for Day 3,
Dialogue: 1,0:17:19.42,0:17:22.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,since that's when cosplayers\Nwill be selling their ROMs.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:22.54,0:17:25.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Nagomi might stay, but Erica and Yoki might not.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:25.58,0:17:30.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,Okay! And this year's Comiket\Nis August 8th through 11th, so...
Dialogue: 1,0:17:30.96,0:17:34.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oh, I can't. My mom and I leave on the\N10th to visit our family grave for Obon.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:34.00,0:17:35.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,You're so normal!
Dialogue: 1,0:17:35.00,0:17:35.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,That's so nice of you!
Dialogue: 1,0:17:35.79,0:17:37.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,You two know you're going to hell, right?
Dialogue: 1,0:17:37.88,0:17:41.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,All that's left, then, is to make your announcement.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:41.25,0:17:44.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Most people decide who they want\Nto see the day before they go,
Dialogue: 1,0:17:44.08,0:17:45.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,so posting about it is critical.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:45.83,0:17:51.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,I-I posted about it,\Nbut I didn't get as many shares as Nagomi-san...
Dialogue: 1,0:17:54.04,0:17:58.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Okay, fine.\NI guess I can make some kind of announcement.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:58.04,0:17:59.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,You're the best, Mikari-chan!
Dialogue: 1,0:17:59.79,0:18:02.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,If Mikarin makes a post on her socials, we're golden...
Dialogue: 1,0:18:02.25,0:18:03.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Please.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:04.04,0:18:09.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,If our competition is posting online,\NI'm not about to stoop to their level.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:12.17,0:18:17.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna be at Comiket on Day 1\Nwith a Liliel Defense Squadron group!
Dialogue: 1,0:18:17.21,0:18:22.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Whoa, hold on, you serious?!\NYou're gonna be cosplaying?!
Dialogue: 1,0:18:22.04,0:18:24.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yeah! I even made my costume!
Dialogue: 1,0:18:24.83,0:18:26.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,You announced it on TV...
Dialogue: 1,0:18:26.54,0:18:27.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Well? Didn't I do good?
Dialogue: 1,0:18:28.92,0:18:31.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Sensei, you're not gonna believe this!
Dialogue: 1,0:18:32.46,0:18:37.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Mikarin is going to Comiket in a Liliel cosplay!\NYou lucky dog, you!
Dialogue: 1,0:18:37.54,0:18:38.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Who?
Dialogue: 1,0:18:38.50,0:18:39.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Seriously?
Dialogue: 1,0:18:39.88,0:18:43.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,You know that cute Liliel cosplayer that\Nwent around social media recently?
Dialogue: 1,0:18:43.92,0:18:47.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I heard something about that.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:47.08,0:18:50.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,She's gonna be cosplaying with her!\NWe've gotta go see them in person!
Dialogue: 1,0:18:50.75,0:18:53.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,No, I'll pass. It'll be too hot and crowded.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:53.71,0:18:56.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,What, and give up the opportunity to\Nsee your characters cosplayed?!
Dialogue: 1,0:18:56.71,0:18:58.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,You've gotta want to see them in person!
Dialogue: 1,0:18:58.25,0:19:01.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Cosplayers are getting\Ncrazy good these days, too!
Dialogue: 1,0:19:01.54,0:19:04.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'd want to if it were my own series.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:04.33,0:19:06.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Not this again.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:06.08,0:19:10.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,They're doing the Airborne Defense Squadron!\NThat's Side Story!
Dialogue: 1,0:19:10.75,0:19:15.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,And Ariel isn't in the original! She's your character!
Dialogue: 1,0:19:17.46,0:19:20.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Don't you want to see Ariel in person?
Dialogue: 1,0:19:25.79,0:19:26.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Did I upset him?
Dialogue: 1,0:19:29.08,0:19:35.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oh! I know this song, Sensei!\NIt's the one where the violin and G?
Dialogue: 1,0:19:35.13,0:19:36.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Johann Sebastian Bach,
Dialogue: 1,0:19:36.96,0:19:42.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Orchestral Suite No. 3 in D Major,\Nsecond movement, Air on the G String.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:44.25,0:19:45.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Or, "Aria."
Dialogue: 1,0:19:46.88,0:19:49.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's my favorite piece of music in the entire world.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:50.71,0:19:54.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Mita-kun, let me think it over.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:55.50,0:19:56.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 1,0:20:01.50,0:20:07.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,The contours, the reflectivity,\Nthe scaling, the overall balance...
Dialogue: 1,0:20:13.29,0:20:14.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's perfect!
Dialogue: 1,0:20:18.50,0:20:21.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,We passed Okumura's final check!
Dialogue: 1,0:20:21.04,0:20:22.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,So that means...
Dialogue: 1,0:20:23.08,0:20:25.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,Ariel is done!
Dialogue: 1,0:20:25.17,0:20:27.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Thanks, everyone!
Dialogue: 1,0:20:27.54,0:20:29.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Took you guys long enough.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:32.00,0:20:34.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Just you wait, Kisaki-sensei.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:34.79,0:20:36.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,You don't need to protect me.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:36.92,0:20:41.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'll tell everyone how much I love your\Nseries a thousand times if I have to.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:43.04,0:20:45.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Because that's what otaku do!
Dialogue: 1,0:20:49.04,0:20:51.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,I always get so excited the morning of.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:51.79,0:20:52.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Same!
Dialogue: 1,0:20:52.79,0:20:54.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Ririsa-chan!
Dialogue: 1,0:20:54.96,0:20:56.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Morning, babes!
Dialogue: 1,0:20:56.29,0:20:57.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Morning!
Dialogue: 1,0:20:57.21,0:20:58.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Senpai!
Dialogue: 1,0:20:58.63,0:21:01.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Okay, we're all here.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:02.79,0:21:06.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,We should get to Kokusai-Tenjijo station before 8.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:07.04,0:21:09.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's nice getting to relax.\NUsually, I'm on the first train here.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:09.63,0:21:11.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wait, at like 4 AM?!
Dialogue: 1,0:21:11.54,0:21:13.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,You guys are nuts.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:13.92,0:21:16.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Everyone feeling good?\NIt's gonna get hot today.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:17.17,0:21:19.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,I had a hard time getting to sleep 'cause I was so excited.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:19.50,0:21:20.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm full of energy!
Dialogue: 1,0:21:22.38,0:21:24.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Remember everything today, Ririsa?
Dialogue: 1,0:21:24.79,0:21:27.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,I-I've got everything!
Dialogue: 1,0:21:27.50,0:21:31.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Hey, you made that mistake once,\Nnow you'll never make it again!
Dialogue: 1,0:21:31.50,0:21:36.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,I slept well, ate breakfast,\Nremembered everything, and am ready to go!
Dialogue: 1,0:21:37.04,0:21:40.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,I've got zero anxiety this morning!
Dialogue: 1,0:21:40.88,0:21:41.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,You just jinxed it!
Dialogue: 1,0:21:44.08,0:21:46.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,They must all be cosplayers. They've all got bags.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:46.46,0:21:50.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Look at that guy and his harem. Lucky bastard.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:50.29,0:21:52.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,Harem? You've got it wrong.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:54.13,0:21:57.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Those are the eyes of a man\Nwho only gets aroused by 2D girls!
Dialogue: 1,0:21:58.29,0:21:59.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Forgive me, comrade.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:59.88,0:22:00.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Comrade.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:00.79,0:22:01.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Hello, comrades.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:19.96,0:22:21.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,Let's go! It's time...
Dialogue: 1,0:22:22.38,0:22:23.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,...for Comiket!
